#: ../../installation.rst:579
msgid ""
"Notice that under the **Processing Nodes** menu there’s a \"node-odm-1\" "
"node already configured for you to use. This is a NodeODM node and has been "
"created automatically by WebODM. This node is running on the same machine as "
"WebODM."
msgstr ""
"Tazama kwa **Processing Nodes** menu kuna \\\"node-odm-1\\\" node tayari "
"zishapangwa kwa ajili yako kutumia. NodeODM node hii na imetengenezwa "
"wenyewe kwa WebODM. Node hii inatumika katika mashine moja kama WebODM."

#: ../../installation.rst:581
msgid ""
"If you’ve made it this far, congratulations! Now it’s time to start "
"processing some data."
msgstr ""
"Ikiwa umefikia hapo, Hongera! Sasa ni mda wa kuanza kuchakata baadhi ya data."

